./.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-c3s-chatgpt-package-20260908/outside-round3/astra-c3s-docx.md:14:Shielding and MPC are analogies with stronger conditions. Alshiekh et al.’s Safe Reinforcement Learning via Shielding (AAAI, 2018) corrects actions using a synthesized temporal-logic shield. Wabersich and Zeilinger’s A Predictive Safety Filter for Learning-Based Control of Constrained Nonlinear Dynamical Systems (Automatica, 2021) uses a predictive model and uncertainty treatment to certify or modify proposed inputs. C3-S evaluates the current slot and applies a nominal served-count guard; it has neither a supplied temporal-safety proof nor a multi-step coordinator rollout. “Nominal service guard” and “model-based selector” are accurate. “Provably safe shield” and unqualified “MPC” are not supported by the frozen definition. Shielding; predictive safety filter.
