The formal 100-user tape loaded successfully. Tail screening ranked all 90 step×carrier anchors without using outcomes; the 24 selected anchors are now running sequentially, each with four declared selection workers and inherited `nice -n 10`. The first uncensored decision is still completing, which already confirms the cutoff was censoring material work beyond 10 seconds.
