The corrected pilot passed its reconciliation check. On the formal run, the first tail anchor’s uncensored `FULL` validation is taking substantially longer than its formerly reported 9.94 s cutoff path; this is the intended censored region, not the independent comparator now. I’ll keep reporting the completed-anchor cadence as it emerges.
