Even four-row batches failed because the stage‑1/2 worker pool retained the formal tape and worker state while validation ran. I’m switching the profiling-only validation to the parent process after closing that pool. This keeps the coordinator’s parallel discovery/certification path intact and uses the identical exact validator in four-row batches; only the post-certification execution location changes to stay within memory.
